>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ORACLE-CONSTANTS.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BI-OP PIC X(16).
01 BI-TEXT PIC X(8192).
01 BI-LEN PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 BI-ZERO.
   05 Z-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 Z-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 BI-DUMMY-ZERO.
   05 DZ-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 DZ-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 DZ-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 DZ-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 BI-OUT.
   05 O-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 O-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 O-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 O-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 BI-REM.
   05 R-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 R-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 R-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 R-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 BI-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 BI-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-NAME PIC X(16).
01 LK-OUT.
   05 LK-O-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-O-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-O-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-O-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-NAME LK-OUT LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS BI-STATUS BI-CMP
    SET Z-HEAD Z-TAIL DZ-HEAD DZ-TAIL O-HEAD O-TAIL R-HEAD R-TAIL TO NULL
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-NAME)
        WHEN "M"
            MOVE "170141183460469231731687303715884105727" TO BI-TEXT
            MOVE 39 TO BI-LEN
        WHEN "FOUNDATION"
            MOVE "-15055671" TO BI-TEXT
            MOVE 9 TO BI-LEN
        WHEN "TABLETS"
            MOVE "-278522" TO BI-TEXT
            MOVE 7 TO BI-LEN
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 90 TO LK-STATUS
            GOBACK
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE "INIT-TEXT" TO BI-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING BI-OP BI-TEXT BI-LEN BI-ZERO BI-DUMMY-ZERO BI-OUT BI-REM BI-CMP BI-STATUS
    IF BI-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE BI-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
    ELSE
        MOVE BI-OUT TO LK-OUT
    END-IF
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM ORACLE-CONSTANTS.
